  "ADB: full control. Accessibility: TwinDesk on the phone taps and types itself, over Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi Direct or Bluetooth, no developer options": "ADB：完全控制。辅助功能：手机上的 TwinDesk 自己点击和输入，通过 Wi-Fi、Wi-Fi Direct 或蓝牙，无需开发者选项",
  "Click a device, then a place next to another device to move it there, or another device to swap places. Devices sit side by side, with no empty space between them.": "点击一台设备，再点击另一台设备旁边的位置即可移动过去；点击另一台设备则交换位置。设备彼此相邻排列，中间不留空隙。",
  "Computers and phones connected at the same time: one clipboard and one set of notifications for all, each screen edge leading to another device, a phone and a computer together": "多台电脑和手机同时连接：共用一份剪贴板和一套通知，每条屏幕边缘通向另一台设备，手机和电脑一起用",
  "Mount works through ADB, and Developer options are off on the phone. Switch on Developer options and Wireless debugging (Phone page), or plug the phone in with USB debugging on. Phone Files works without ADB.": "挂载通过 ADB 实现，而手机上的开发者选项未开启。请开启开发者选项和无线调试（手机页），或用 USB 线连接并打开 USB 调试。手机文件无需 ADB 即可使用。",
  "Mount works through ADB, and wireless debugging is off on the phone. Switch it on (Phone page), or plug the phone in with USB debugging on. Phone Files works without ADB.": "挂载通过 ADB 实现，而手机上的无线调试未开启。请开启它（手机页），或用 USB 线连接并打开 USB 调试。手机文件无需 ADB 即可使用。",
  "On the same page, turn on Wireless debugging. The phone has to be on a Wi-Fi network (a direct Wi-Fi link alone isn’t enough).": "在同一页面开启无线调试。手机必须连上 Wi-Fi 网络（仅直连 Wi-Fi 不够）。",
  "On the same Wi-Fi network (not Wi-Fi Direct), Bluetooth goes off until the session ends. With a computer, phones can’t find this one meanwhile": "在同一 Wi-Fi 网络（非 Wi-Fi Direct）下，蓝牙会关闭直到会话结束。期间手机将发现不了本机",
  "Open TwinDesk › Remote there, then Touchpad and keyboard or Gamepad. Its speed, tap to click and the gamepad’s keys are set there": "在对方打开 TwinDesk › 远程，然后选择触控板和键盘或手柄。速度、点按和手柄按键都在那里设置",
  "Optional. Adds an extra screen for the other computer (Extend). Installs a display driver and asks for administrator rights once.": "可选。为另一台电脑添加一块扩展显示器（扩展）。会安装显示驱动，只需一次管理员授权。",
  "Pair once: Wireless debugging › Pair device with pairing code on the phone, then type the code in the Pairing code row below.": "只需配对一次：在手机上进入无线调试 › 使用配对码配对设备，然后在下方“配对码”一行输入该码。",
  "Pair with one device and the rest connect to this one by themselves. Devices you pair with can introduce others, without a pairing code": "与一台设备配对后，其余设备会自动连上来。已配对的设备可以介绍其他设备加入，无需配对码",
  "Tap Wireless debugging › Pair device with pairing code, and type the code here, or in TwinDesk’s notification on the phone.": "点按无线调试 › 使用配对码配对设备，把码输入到这里，或输入到手机上 TwinDesk 的通知里。",
  "The screen works, but Xiaomi refuses touch, mouse and keyboard from here. On the phone: Settings › Developer options › USB debugging (Security settings): on (it asks for a Mi account).": "屏幕可以看，但小米拒绝来自本机的触控、鼠标和键盘。请在手机上：设置 › 开发者选项 › USB 调试（安全设置）：开启（需要登录小米账号）。",
  "Title bar: Back, Home, Recents and the main ones up top. Side panel: those, volume, rotate, screenshot and more down the right of each phone window. Bottom bar: Back, Home and Recents under the picture": "标题栏：返回、主屏、多任务和主要按键在顶部。侧栏：这些按键外加音量、旋转、截图等，在每个手机窗口右侧。底栏：画面下方的返回、主屏和多任务",
  "TwinDesk pairs with the phone’s wireless debugging once. After that the phone’s screen, apps, mouse and keyboard work without this step.": "TwinDesk 与手机的无线调试只需配对一次。之后手机的屏幕、应用、鼠标和键盘无需再走这一步。",

